  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "background",
      "title": "Background",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Back in the day, when to-be Speiz team was on the hunt for a warehouse, they felt like the industry is analog, outdated, and full of traditional barriers. What they expected to be a straightforward process turned into endless scrolling through confusing listings, unclear terms, and constant back-and-forth with multiple middlemen.",
            "Frustrated by their own struggles, the team had a light bulb moment: What if leasing a warehouse could be as simple as booking a hotel room?",
            "That's the spark that ignited Speiz. The team decided to design a platform to spare businesses the headache they went through."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "challenge",
      "title": "Challenge",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Our competitor audit, tenant interviews, and landlord calls revealed recurring pain points that turn a simple space hunt into weeks of guess-work."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Fragmented data across different sources",
            "Hidden vacancy",
            "Missing specs",
            "Out-of-date visuals",
            "PDF time-sink",
            "Broker-led e-mail chains",
            "Trust gap"
          ],
          "ordered": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "goal",
      "title": "Goal",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Our main goal was mapping the chaos: help tenants shortlist viable spaces in \\"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Single hub of warehouses in Norway",
            "Maximum available spaces",
            "Full spec data",
            "Zero PDFs",
            "Price range",
            "Fresh photos",
            "Availability updates"
          ],
          "ordered": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
